            graphs=(("Gameplay performance",("Average FPS","Gameplay P1")),("P1 / Average consistency",("P1 / Average %",)),("Junction temperature",("Average junction","Maximum junction")),("Board power",("Average board power",)),("GPU utilization",("Average GPU utilization",)),("Comparative session FPS/W",("Gameplay FPS/W",)))
